  "description": "A management UI for YARP (Yet Another Reverse Proxy): visualize routes as an interactive map, edit routes, clusters and destinations live without restarts, watch proxied request logs, and protect it all with built-in authentication. Hosts standalone or embedded in any ASP.NET Core app.",
